{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_MetaData_Summary_4__2_.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now! Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.\u00a0  Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_Metadata_Summary_2__1_.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly\u2014stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. \ud83d\udef0\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_Meta_Data_Summary_5.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form\u2014but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_Meta_Summary_6.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities\u2014like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670460?t=1745249802","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/af4fe630c4d555c9ab15b823746122705e28d390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745249802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/9b24e457fff9cbea2791cfd409a7573f881ff24b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745249802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/9b24e457fff9cbea2791cfd409a7573f881ff24b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745249802","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, Gore, Horror elements. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_MetaData_Summary_4__2_.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now! Inspired by Dead By Daylight and Among Us, <strong>BlackGate</strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer experience where every player has a unique role to play.\u00a0  Up to 4 Engineers are pit against an alien specimen controlled by a 5th player with one goal: Survival. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_Metadata_Summary_2__1_.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an engineer, you and your team are sent to repair <strong>BlackGate</strong> station. Your mission is clear: restore power to the station, unlock crucial systems, and most importantly\u2014stay alive. Each engineer plays a crucial role in the survival of their team. \ud83d\udef0\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_Meta_Data_Summary_5.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Alien begins inside the nest deep within the ship, working its way towards its prey. As the specimen, your goal is simple but deadly. You start in a weak, larval form\u2014but every engineer you harm makes you stronger. \ud83d\udc7e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/extras/BlackGate_Meta_Summary_6.gif?t=1745249802\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once you evolve, you unlock new abilities\u2014like heightened senses to detect your prey, or faster movement, and deadly attacks. In your final form, you become an unstoppable force, capable of taking on the engineers head-to-head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["VRMonkey","Megaverse LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670460/ab3f94d49f945eb8e7a78758c1ee3d314edaf6c1/header.jpg?t=1745249802","is_free":false,"legal_notice":" BlackGate\u2122 and all characters, names, and elements are trademarks of and \u00a9 2025 Megaverse LLC, a Fun Train\u00ae company.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126393,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126393/movie480.mp4?t=1745249800","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126393/movie_max.mp4?t=1745249800"},"name":"BlackGate Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126393/b5652887656a3d4509c2d2d04c39d5443af466dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745249800","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_